{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026AViI064uX51795158232.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>維他奶中期純利升逾百分之7。</p><p></p><p>截至9月底半年賺1.8億元，中期息維持每股4仙。受惠匯率變動，收入升百分之3至33億元，毛利率上升0.8個百分點，至近五成二水平。</p><p></p><p>集團預期，價格競爭加劇、油價高企及澳洲業務重組，以重新聚焦常溫產品，將對下半年度盈利能力，構成顯著負面影響。 </p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:24:03.425444+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T07:03:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T10:17:16.341017+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T08:17:18.224027+00:00","content_hash":"ee30fb43665bf6ecc5c8a49950e67856da3b648d4381f76a73a0119945e58fad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:24:03.425444+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}